&lt;h3 id="4-docker-composeyaml-작성"&gt;&lt;a href="#4-docker-composeyaml-%ec%9e%91%ec%84%b1" class="header-anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;4. &lt;code&gt;docker-compose.yaml&lt;/code&gt; 작성
